{'symbol': 'KDP', 'date': '2021-06-08 08:45:00', 'title': 'KEURIG DR PEPPER ANNOUNCES PRICING OF SECONDARY OFFERING OF COMMON STOCK ON BEHALF OF MONDELĒZ INTERNATIONAL', 'text': 'BURLINGTON, MASS. AND FRISCO, TEXAS, JUNE 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KEURIG DR PEPPER (NASDAQ: KDP) (THE "COMPANY" OR "KDP") ANNOUNCED TODAY THE PRICING OF ITS PREVIOUSLY-ANNOUNCED REGISTERED PUBLIC SECONDARY OFFERING OF 28 MILLION SHARES OF THE COMPANY\'S OUTSTANDING COMMON STOCK ON BEHALF OF MONDELĒZ INTERNATIONAL HOLDINGS LLC ("MONDELĒZ"), AT A PRICE TO THE PUBLIC OF $35.65 PER SHARE.'}